                "index": 1,
                "label": "working_response",
                "anchor_before": "(2)若$\\text{x}_1$, $\\text{x}_2$满足$2\\text{x}_1 = |\\text{x}_2| - 1$, 求t的值.",
                "anchor_after": "14.",
                "regions": [
                  {
                    "answer_bbox": [
                      440,
                      410,
                      960,
                      615
                    ],
                    "transcription": "$x_1 + x_2 = 2$\n$x_1x_2 = t-5$\n$\\because 2x_1 = |x_2| -1$\n$\\therefore |x_2|= 2x_1 +1$\n① $x_2<0$\n$x_1 + (-2x_1 -1) = 2$, $x_1=-3, x_2=5$ 矛盾, 舍去\n② $x_2\\geq 0$\n$x_1 + (2x_1 +1) = 2$\n$\\therefore x_1= \\frac{1}{3}, x_2= \\frac{5}{3}$\n$\\therefore x_1x_2 = \\frac{1}{3}\\times \\frac{5}{3} = \\frac{5}{9}$\n$\\therefore t-5= \\frac{5}{9}$\n$\\therefore t= \\frac{50}{9}$",
                    "legible": true,
                    "content_kind": "handwriting",
                    "confidence": 0.93
